# S10: reference tests of the S10 groups not ported in S10, one reason each (dev/plans/S2.md, section 3).

# cleanup
cleanup/005-write_cancelled_at_reactor_shutdown.phpt  rfc-rule:2026-10-01 Reactor = one per-thread php_io_queue (a libuv write cancelled at loop close, armed by the reference's fuzz hook)

# fork
fork/001-fork_guard_active_coroutine.phpt  rfc-rule:2026-10-06 pcntl_fork() is refused only while an op is in flight, not while coroutines exist

# socket
socket/004-socket_ipv6_hostname_async.phpt  fixture:network (google.com and an IPv6 socket; its output cannot tell a blocking resolution from an async one)

